  "Package": "enrichmet",
  "Type": "Package",
  "Title": "enrichmet: R package for Quick and Easy Pathway and Network\nAnalyses in Metabolomics",
  "Version": "0.99.21",
  "Authors@R": "c(\nperson(\"Yonatan\", \"Mekonnen\", email = \"yaayalew@gmail.com\",\nrole = c(\"aut\", \"cre\"),\ncomment = c(ORCID = \"0000-0002-7430-9428\")),\nperson(given = \"H. Lee Moffitt Cancer Center & Research Institute\",\nrole = \"fnd\",\ncomment = \"Grant number: P01CA250984\")\n)",
  "Description": "Provides functions to perform metabolite-based pathway\nenrichment analysis using Fisher's exact test and MetSEA.\nComputes relative betweenness centrality (RBC) of input\nmetabolites in a pathway-metabolite interaction network. The\npackage generates visualizations including pathway dot plots,\nMetSEA plots, metabolite centrality plots, and network plots.\nIt supports KEGG-based pathway inputs and generates exportable\nresults.",
